# AGENTS.md — Freedom Soapbox

Parent company workspace for all projects under Freedom Soapbox.

## Company Hierarchy

- **Freedom Soapbox** (parent company)
  - `fs-records` (music production)
    - `afroviolin` (current flagship project)
    - future music projects
  - `hca-daily` (cooking show)
  - `fs-family-vlog`
  - other future projects

## Core Rules

- Local disk usage ≤ 50% at all times
- All large media assets stored in Cloudflare R2
- One bucket per project (or per company division)
- Use `scripts/storage/storage_manager.py` for new project setup
- Full autonomy expected (Ralph Loop)

## Key Locations

- `fs-records/afroviolin/` — current music video pipeline
- `agents/` — shared agent tooling
- `scripts/storage/` — storage automation
- `STORAGE.md` — storage architecture
- `AGENTS.md` — this file

